	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『宇宙戦艦ヤマト2205 新たなる旅立ち』に登場する宇宙戦艦ヤマトの右翼を担う補給母艦アスカが1/1000シリーズで待望のラインアップ！",
			"■艦橋は付属のLEDユニットにより青く発光させることが可能。",
			"■細部までこだわった精密なディテールと水転写式デカールで船体甲板のラインを再現。",
			"■専用ディスプレイベース付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"The long-awaited lineup of the supply carrier Asuka, which plays the right wing of Space Battleship Yamato in \"Space Battleship Yamato 2205: A New Journey\", is now available in the 1/1000 series!",
			"• The bridge can be illuminated in blue using the included LED unit.",
			"• Accurate details and water transfer decals recreate the lines of the hull deck.",
			"• Comes with a dedicated display base."
		]
	},
	"accessories": {
